## 構文の色と診断
size 20x6 cursor 3,2 block
   |E func f() {        |
fg |..kkkk..............|
fx |    ~~~~~           |
   |W         // note   |
fg |..........ccccsks...|
fx |             ____   |
   |W         return "s"|
fg |..sssssssssskkkk.sss|
fx |  _________         |
   |  }                 |
   | NORMAL  [ 4,1  All |
fx |SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS|
   |                    |

## 選択を重ねる
size 20x6 cursor 0,9 block
   |func f() {          |
fg |kkkk................|
fx |  vvvvvvv           |
   |        // note     |
fg |........ccccsks.....|
   |        return "s"  |
fg |sssssssssskkkk.sss..|
   |}                   |
   | VISUAL   1,10  All |
fx |SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS|
   |                    |
